    "However, once COVID retreated, V and his friends returned to their college classrooms and the podcast dropped off their radar. But even now, as a young techie in a startup, football takes up space and time in his life. When I ask him, what football means to him, understandably he struggles to provide a substantial answer because it cannot be distilled down to one thing.",
