    "It happened by chance. A few sporadic encounters – a board game night with a friend, a happy evening rolling dice and planning moves at a game café – eventually climaxed during the lockdown. R along with his wife and daughters was quarantining with another family and needed something to occupy themselves, especially during weekend evenings when outings were not possible. They needed something that pulled everyone away from their screens and board games proved to be the circuit breaker.",
