    "However, what had until then been a private interest soon became an instrument to connect with the community he lived in. Someone asked him if could organise board game nights in the library and R thought why not. I remember seeing the WhatsApp messages announcing the event but my own social anxiety coupled with the fear of not being able to ‘perform’ (as silly as that sounds) ensured that I stayed away.",
